<p>    HIGH  5.26		  5.36		 99.795</p>
<p> AVERAGE  5.24		  5.33		 99.796</p>
<p>TOTAL BIDS $60.065 BLN OR 2.00 TIMES AMOUNT SOLD</p>
<p>		     AWARDED AT HIGH DISCOUNT: 32 PCT</p>
